        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a new page to our list of \"attacks\", this one is on JavaScript Prototype Pollution.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Generally, I'm not sure if I covered everything that needs to appear here. I think I'm somewhat happy about the defenses part, but explaining how to actually get into to polluting objects might need some more words?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also, I think this needs integration into JS docs (at a minimum some linkage).</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Developing a series of guides about common attacks on websites, explaining for each attack: how it works, the impact, and how to defend against it.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Would love some feedback from <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/wbamberg/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/wbamberg\">@wbamberg</a>, <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/aaronshim/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/aaronshim\">@aaronshim</a> and maybe <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Josh-Cena\">@Josh-Cena</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">None, I think.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41260",
            "title": "Add a page for JavaScript prototype pollution attack",
